From ac2d8b08651ee3e367b8633a84899d614cfe27c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "David C. Manuelda" <StormByte@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Mar 2026 18:47:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/18] Doc: Update Windows doc for MSVC build

Signed-off-by: David C. Manuelda <StormByte@gmail.com>
---
